## Interface: 30300
## Title: Raid Recruiter
## Notes: Two tools for running a raid. Recruiting: posts your LFM message to the channels you pick on a timer and collects everyone who whispers you into a sortable applicant list with their item level, level and role. Loot rolls: puts a boss drop up for roll in /rw, tracks who rolled what, and hands the item to the winner -- from the corpse by master loot, or by trade when you already looted it into your own bags. Class check: asks the raid in a raid warning to write their role in chat and reads the answers back into the composition readout. /rr
## Author: Deniz
